        "Broadcasts a signal to another process.": "向其他流程广播信号。",
        "An end event without a defined result.": "没有已定义结果的结束事件。",
        "A message is sent to an external system at the conclusion of the process.": "在流程结束时向外部系统发送消息。",
        "A named error is generated when the end of the process has been reached.": "在到达流程末尾时生成已命名的错误。",
        "Triggers an escalation when the end of the process has been reached.": "在到达流程末尾时触发升级。",
        "Indicates that the transaction should be cancelled at the end of the process.": "表示应在流程结束时取消事务。",
