        "Triggered from a specific time date or specific cycle that can be set and does not interrupt the activity it is attached to.": "根据可设置的特定时间日期或特定周期触发，但不中断其附加到的活动。",
        "Triggered when a condition becomes true and does not interrupt the activity it is attached to.": "当条件为 True 时触发，但不中断其附加到的活动。",
