        "Receives a message from an external system.": "從外部系統接收訊息。",
        "Triggered when a condition becomes true.": "在條件成立時觸發。",
        "Connects two sections of a process.": "連線程序的兩個區段。",
        "Triggered when compensation is required to reverse the effects of completed activities.": "當需要補償來扭轉已完成活動的影響時觸發。",
        "Receives a signal from another process.": "從另一個程序接收訊號。",
        "Sends a message to an external system.": "將訊息傳送至外部系統。",
        "Raises an escalation to expedite the completion of an activity.": "提出升級以加速完成活動。",
