        "Broadcasts a signal to another process.": "將訊號廣播至另一個程序。",
        "An end event without a defined result.": "沒有定義結果的結束事件。",
        "A message is sent to an external system at the conclusion of the process.": "在程序結束時，系統向外部系統傳送一則訊息。",
