        "Receives a signal from another process and interrupts the activity it is attached to.": "從另一個程序接收訊號，並中斷其所附加的活動。",
        "Triggered from a specific time date or specific cycle that can be set and interrupts the activity it is attached to.": "從可設定的特定時間日期或特定週期觸發，並中斷附加其所附加的活動。",
        "Triggered when a message is received from an external system and does not interrupt the activity it is attached to.": "從外部系統接收到訊息且不會中斷其所附加的活動時觸發。",
